WEBVTT

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:23.189
Rest assured, big sis.
I'll bring back your runaway daughter.

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:25.984
Though I have to say,
you don't make it easy.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.819
What's the deal with your lackeys?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.488
The deputy commander is a fastidious man.

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:34.784
<i>They are there with the expressed interest</i>
<i>of testing our new weaponry.</i>

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.369
<i>Truth is, their goal is surveillance.</i>

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:40.206
<i>I'm sure they're trying to find</i>
<i>dirt on me by using Momo.</i>

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.710
-You should just quit politics.
<i>-Quiet!</i>

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.337
Just do as you're told!

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:48.548
<i>You haven't changed one bit.</i>

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:51.217
<i>Have you no sense of urgency?</i>

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:54.137
<i>You owe me your life, remember?</i>

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.388
How's it looking?

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.682
We won't be able to trail them
through there on wheels.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.809
How shall we proceed?

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.062
Let's see
if the neighboring town can help us.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:07.192
Hey, what do you plan
to do in the neighboring town?

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:09.944
Now, now. Don't be nervous.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:14.365
I'm sure we won't need your
flimsy little toy to settle this matter.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.411
Whatever. Who does he think he is?

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:35.053
Come, have a seat.
You should eat before it gets cold.

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:39.432
You think I'll fall for that, vampire?
You're trying to fatten me up to eat me.

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:41.559
Delicious!

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:48.066
So do you like singing?

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.109
I hate singing.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.947
-So why were you singing back there?
-Well, that's…

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:59.035
-My mom…
-What about your mom?

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:00.870
I…

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.834
It seems
you don't understand much about yourself.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.170
What a typical Warm.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.390
This song…

00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:23.977
Do you recognize it?
It's the song that you were singing.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.104
Can you sing along?

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:31.734
If it seems fun,
you should follow that feeling.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.572
Listen to your heart.
Let your body move as it wants to.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:38.283
Just like this.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:43.955
Isn't it fantastic?

00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:47.208
Come. Let's dance the night away.

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:48.960
We'll dance till the end of time.

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:50.753
What are you doing? Let go!

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.966
You stink of alcohol. You're depraved.

00:02:55.466 --> 00:02:59.387
I thought you were a good person,
but you're just a typical vampire.

00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:02.056
It was your decision to come with me.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.100
I shared good food and music with you.

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:06.436
Can't you let yourself enjoy this
even for a second?

00:03:09.939 --> 00:03:11.441
You vampires did this…

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:14.861
to Mirena.

00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:22.660
That's enough for today.

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:28.499
Why don't you take this
and go wherever you like?

00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:32.295
You're free to do as you please.

00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:43.431
Wherever I want?

00:03:44.349 --> 00:03:45.934
Where am I supposed to go?

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:50.563
Mirena…

00:04:01.199 --> 00:04:05.245
"A place where vampires and humans
create music together."

00:04:05.828 --> 00:04:06.788
"A paradise."

00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:18.258
Fine is obligated
to sit upon this imperial throne.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.969
It's her duty to continue our bloodline,

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:24.389
to sacrifice her flesh
in service to our kind.

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:29.102
Allegro, you must rescue
the queen from her debauchery.

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:32.146
This is your last chance
to redeem yourself,

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:37.652
after raging forward with such
a reckless plan and failing miserably.

00:04:38.319 --> 00:04:41.114
Understood. I promise to return our queen.

00:05:01.342 --> 00:05:03.011
<i>Wake up, Momo.</i>

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:06.180
<i>Wake up, Momo. Fulfill your duties.</i>

00:05:36.377 --> 00:05:39.672
This painting. The same one
is painted on the music box.

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:37.438
<i>Momo, where do you think you're going?</i>

00:06:40.858 --> 00:06:41.734
<i>Momo!</i>

00:06:42.985 --> 00:06:43.820
<i>Help me!</i>

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:48.282
<i>Traitor! Why are you running away?</i>

00:06:52.036 --> 00:06:56.332
<i>I'm sorry. I won't be able</i>
<i>to listen to the music box.</i>

00:07:07.009 --> 00:07:08.010
I…

00:07:08.928 --> 00:07:10.471
It's all my fault.

00:07:11.013 --> 00:07:12.932
I'm sorry, Mirena.

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:16.644
I've never met a person
that can puke while walking.

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.647
The cleanup was hard work.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:22.984
I'll probably have to rip out
all of the carpet and replace it.

00:07:23.067 --> 00:07:23.985
What?

00:07:24.735 --> 00:07:27.780
I'm joking. Don't take it seriously.

00:07:28.489 --> 00:07:29.907
You probably had a fever.

00:07:30.908 --> 00:07:32.285
Figures. You went through a lot.

00:07:34.412 --> 00:07:37.915
While I was carrying you here, it seemed
like something was tormenting you.

00:07:41.711 --> 00:07:45.673
It's a record.
I've been wanting to play it for you.

00:07:51.846 --> 00:07:53.723
The singer is a Warm.

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:56.767
-They're not vampires.
-No way.

00:07:57.393 --> 00:08:00.271
-It's true.
-I can't believe it.

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:10.198
She would sing about the people she lost.

00:08:11.115 --> 00:08:13.993
She sang to ease the pain
of being left behind.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:18.915
What were you singing for?

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.376
Do you know what you want out of life?

00:08:25.922 --> 00:08:26.923
Want to take a look?

00:08:27.715 --> 00:08:30.551
They've distilled their emotions
into the lyrics.

00:08:31.761 --> 00:08:32.803
Okay.

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:36.891
I'm sorry.

00:08:37.517 --> 00:08:38.601
What for?

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:40.394
That you had to clean up after me.

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:42.605
Don't worry about it.

00:09:17.181 --> 00:09:19.892
The picture is not here. It couldn't be…

00:09:24.647 --> 00:09:27.149
-How's it looking?
-We did indeed find it.

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.776
A single house in the mountains.

00:09:29.527 --> 00:09:34.031
It's a dacha that was built
about 100 years ago by a famous artist.

00:09:35.616 --> 00:09:39.120
Are they ready to go?
The herd is getting hungry.

00:09:39.203 --> 00:09:41.038
Yeah. I'll go hand these out.

00:09:42.582 --> 00:09:45.710
You're feeding blood to the vampires?
Why not kill them?

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.546
It's good to keep up appearances.

00:09:48.629 --> 00:09:50.923
They can't manage
their cravings for blood.

00:09:51.507 --> 00:09:53.843
It's better to appeal to their needs
and gain cooperation

00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:57.805
than to have them lose their better
judgment and start hunting humans.

00:10:21.495 --> 00:10:24.373
That looks great on you.

00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:26.584
You're able to walk in the sunlight?

00:10:27.168 --> 00:10:28.336
Of course not.

00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:33.174
I didn't know
vampires could be into gardening.

00:10:34.216 --> 00:10:38.012
Nothing compares to watching
moonlight azaleas glow under the moon.

00:10:41.724 --> 00:10:44.769
-What's wrong?
-It's nothing.

00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:47.480
It appears I've gotten
a little too much sun.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.107
Why don't you finish this for me?

00:10:50.608 --> 00:10:52.193
What? I can't.

00:10:56.822 --> 00:11:00.368
Is this your home?
Does anyone live with you?

00:11:00.951 --> 00:11:03.079
It's just me and you in this house.

00:11:03.579 --> 00:11:04.872
No one else is here.

00:11:05.581 --> 00:11:07.875
You should search for your friends.

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:09.251
You can fly, after all.

00:11:10.252 --> 00:11:12.380
I feel more comfortable being on my own.

00:11:12.463 --> 00:11:15.132
If it's just me, no one gets hurt.

00:11:28.062 --> 00:11:31.607
Thank you for trying to protect Mirena.

00:11:33.067 --> 00:11:35.903
I'm sorry. I was too late.

00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:47.498
I know it won't change what happened,

00:11:48.916 --> 00:11:50.835
but I'd like to try singing that song

00:11:51.669 --> 00:11:52.962
for Mirena.

00:11:55.005 --> 00:11:56.298
Could you help me?

00:12:43.387 --> 00:12:45.931
Do you think your niece is still alive?

00:12:46.557 --> 00:12:48.601
They might've taken her by now.

00:12:50.227 --> 00:12:54.023
Listen here, you're not to use that toy
until I say so. Got it?

00:12:55.274 --> 00:12:56.692
Who does he think he is?

00:12:56.775 --> 00:12:58.944
Roll out the machines
as soon as we arrive.

00:12:59.028 --> 00:13:00.112
-Roger that.
-Roger that.

00:13:03.491 --> 00:13:05.534
The Warms are getting closer.

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:08.287
Let's go.
It's time to bring our queen home.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.414
Show no mercy to anyone that interferes.

00:13:41.987 --> 00:13:43.364
Target identified.

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:47.117
-I have her.
-Let me go!

00:13:47.201 --> 00:13:48.744
No! Why?

00:13:48.827 --> 00:13:51.539
-No! Let me go!
-Quit it, girl. Hey!

00:13:53.415 --> 00:13:57.211
Let's go home, Momo.
You uncle is here to take you.

00:13:57.878 --> 00:14:00.422
-Who are you?
-Come on, Momo.

00:14:00.506 --> 00:14:01.840
Have you forgotten me?

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:05.302
It's me. Remember?
I used to change your diapers.

00:14:05.386 --> 00:14:08.806
-No. I have no clue who you are.
-What?

00:14:08.889 --> 00:14:11.141
Let me go. I'm not going home!

00:14:12.393 --> 00:14:14.603
Hey, have you been bitten?

00:14:14.687 --> 00:14:17.106
Stop it. I'm not bitten.

00:14:17.189 --> 00:14:19.775
Momo, you've been fooled.

00:14:19.858 --> 00:14:22.903
Did they play music and show you movies?

00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:25.281
Those are age-old tactics that they use.

00:14:25.865 --> 00:14:28.242
Once they're bored,
they'll suck you dry and kill you.

00:14:28.325 --> 00:14:29.618
That's not true!

00:14:32.413 --> 00:14:33.455
Boss!

00:14:50.639 --> 00:14:51.682
Stop right there.

00:14:52.975 --> 00:14:55.311
-Momo!
-That hurt. How dare you?

00:14:55.394 --> 00:14:58.355
-Boss!
-Don't worry about me. Get Momo.

00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:03.277
Make sure we capture
the commander's daughter before they do.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.194
Roger that.

00:15:08.824 --> 00:15:11.118
Warm! Where is Fine?

00:15:14.997 --> 00:15:16.373
It can't be.

00:15:18.167 --> 00:15:19.418
You…

00:15:23.631 --> 00:15:26.884
Are you okay?
Here. Protect yourself with this.

00:15:30.429 --> 00:15:33.807
Let her go. You heard her.
She doesn't want to go home.

00:15:34.391 --> 00:15:36.310
So have you fallen for her?

00:15:36.393 --> 00:15:38.604
I feel sorry for her. That's all.

00:15:38.687 --> 00:15:40.940
I can't return her to a mother like that.

00:15:41.774 --> 00:15:43.859
I have to say, I agree with you.

00:15:44.652 --> 00:15:47.404
But I can't let you have Momo.

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.637
Get down here, Momo.

00:16:12.596 --> 00:16:14.598
Why are you so stubborn?

00:16:19.812 --> 00:16:21.313
-You--
-Fine.

00:16:21.939 --> 00:16:24.900
-Allegro.
-The elders want to speak with you.

00:16:24.984 --> 00:16:27.528
-Come with me.
-I'd rather not.

00:16:27.611 --> 00:16:29.446
Tell them I'm dead.

00:16:31.031 --> 00:16:32.366
Amazing.

00:16:32.449 --> 00:16:35.119
It's not too late. Come back home.

00:16:35.661 --> 00:16:37.830
I'll take care of everything
just like before.

00:16:37.997 --> 00:16:39.123
Don't be reckless, Momo.

00:16:39.665 --> 00:16:41.500
I won't let you suffer.

00:16:42.459 --> 00:16:43.752
You vampires…

00:16:43.836 --> 00:16:46.839
We can't regain the things we've lost.
Don't let them hold you back.

00:16:52.219 --> 00:16:53.303
Fine!

00:17:15.451 --> 00:17:16.994
Run to that shed.

00:17:24.585 --> 00:17:27.254
Don't forget this. I know it's important.

00:17:27.337 --> 00:17:29.298
What are you going to do?

00:17:29.381 --> 00:17:32.885
I'm a vampire.
I can fly wherever I need to.

00:17:33.385 --> 00:17:34.344
Now go!

00:17:39.975 --> 00:17:42.269
As hard as you may try,
you're still a vampire.

00:17:42.352 --> 00:17:43.854
Show me your true form.

00:17:43.937 --> 00:17:46.065
Sorry to disappoint, but this is who I am.

00:17:58.494 --> 00:18:00.871
Crap, this was my favorite weapon.

00:18:02.206 --> 00:18:04.625
Don't you have more pressing things
to worry about?

00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:09.171
Get in!

00:18:10.714 --> 00:18:12.174
Let's go, Momo.

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:13.592
Stop, Momo!

00:18:14.593 --> 00:18:15.427
What's wrong?

00:18:16.303 --> 00:18:18.555
-The road is blocked.
-Go down the cliff.

00:18:18.639 --> 00:18:21.225
-There's a road below. Hurry!
-What?

00:18:21.809 --> 00:18:23.977
-They're aiming at us from behind.
-What?

00:18:24.061 --> 00:18:26.355
-Trust me.
-Stop, Momo.

00:18:27.481 --> 00:18:28.649
Do it!

00:18:57.511 --> 00:19:00.097
So are there people after you too?

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:03.517
There are those who wish
to rid me of my freedom.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.686
I'd be forced to live by their agendas.

00:19:06.311 --> 00:19:08.939
So I have no intention of returning.

00:19:10.107 --> 00:19:11.900
You're just like me.

00:19:11.984 --> 00:19:13.235
Now that you mention it…

00:19:18.073 --> 00:19:21.243
So this is my first time driving.

00:19:21.326 --> 00:19:24.037
Are you serious?
Look ahead. In front of you!

00:19:37.759 --> 00:19:39.219
Dawn will break soon.

00:19:40.095 --> 00:19:41.972
Let's wait till sundown.

00:19:51.106 --> 00:19:52.357
Your home…

00:19:54.651 --> 00:19:55.819
I'm sorry.

00:19:56.653 --> 00:19:58.113
It's not your fault.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.367
Do you have some place to go?

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.245
Who's to say?

00:20:07.289 --> 00:20:08.749
The painting from that house.

00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:11.585
It was of this same scene.

00:20:11.668 --> 00:20:15.214
A paradise where vampires
and humans live together.

00:20:18.759 --> 00:20:20.260
There's no place like that.

00:20:20.344 --> 00:20:22.095
But you believe there could be.

00:20:22.638 --> 00:20:24.473
That's why you took care of those objects.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:30.229
Like you said,
I don't know anything about myself.

00:20:30.896 --> 00:20:33.565
But I know I want to see places
that I've never been before.

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:39.738
Hey, if you have no place to go,
why don't we try finding it ourselves?

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.157
I'll be your driver.

00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:48.914
Okay.

00:20:49.706 --> 00:20:51.792
-What? Really?
-Yeah.

00:20:51.875 --> 00:20:54.211
All right! Let's go.

00:20:55.921 --> 00:20:58.215
Hold on. You go on that side.

00:20:58.298 --> 00:20:59.132
No fun.

00:21:00.592 --> 00:21:02.761
Could you not call me "you"?

00:21:02.844 --> 00:21:05.514
Call me Momo. And you?

00:21:06.098 --> 00:21:06.974
I'm Fine.

00:21:22.739 --> 00:21:25.450
-Fine is a nice name.
-Thanks.

00:21:26.285 --> 00:21:29.538
-Okay. Let's get going.
-All right. Let's go.

00:23:16.311 --> 00:23:21.316
Subtitle translation by: Angie Yaeyama
